===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|de|Fussball||Switzerland|Liechtenstein|sometimes [[Luxembourg]]|[[South Tyrol]]}}

===Etymology===
{{root|de|ine-pro|*ped-}}
From {{affix|de|Fuß|t1=foot|Ball|t2=ball}}, a {{calque|de|en|football|nocap=1}}. Doublet of the later borrowing {{doublet|de|Football|t1=American football|notext=1}}.

